# Testing
# Narrowed from a blanket `tests/`: the browser suites are the only automated
# coverage this plugin has, and ignoring the whole directory is what kept them
# living in scratch folders where they were lost between sessions. They are not
# packaged either way — `tests` is absent from package.json's `files`, which is
# the only thing that decides what ships.
tests/*
!tests/browser/
phpunit.xml
.phpunit.result.cache
phpcs.xml
.phpcs.xml

# CI/CD
.github/
.gitlab-ci.yml
.travis.yml

# Claude Code / AI
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
.claude.md
*.plan.md

# Local-only developer documentation (not shipped, not pushed to GitHub).
# Every Markdown doc stays on the local machine only — except README.md, which is
# the public GitHub landing page (it is still stripped from the distributable zip).
*.md
!README.md
!ROADMAP.md

# Git
.git/

# Misc
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
.sass-cache/

# Screenshots the browser suites emit while running.
tests/browser/*.png

# Captured markup + emitted screenshots (regenerated by the suites).
tests/browser/.settings-ai.html
tests/browser/fixture-settings.html
